OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed over rape of woman on
OL,4,Acity common
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested after a woman was raped
OL,7,Fby a stranger on Southampton Common has
OL,8,Fbeen released on police bail.
OL,10,FThe woman, aged in her 30s, was
OL,11,Fattacked near Cemetery Road on Saturday
OL,12,Fat about 05:30 GMT. She is being
OL,13,Fsupported by specialist officers.
OL,15,FHampshire police said a 42-year-old
OL,16,Fman, from Southampton, arrested on
OL,17,FSunday on suspicion of rape had been
OL,18,Fbailed with strict conditions.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
